  "remarks": "Public Joint Stock Company “MTS-Bank” is a major Russian universal commercial bank. It carries out banking operations as well as depositary, dealership and brokerage activities. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the RussianFederation. Therefore, Public Joint Stock Company “MTS-Bank” is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
